# UI Rules

Read `docs/10_UI_SYSTEM.md` and `docs/11_COMPONENT_LIBRARY.md`.

## Design Tokens

- Colors: CSS variables (`--background`, `--brand-primary`, etc.) — no raw `#hex` in components
- Typography: use documented scale (`text-display-md`, `text-body-md`, etc.)
- Spacing: 4px grid; generous section padding
- Radius: cards `rounded-2xl`, buttons `rounded-xl`, inputs `rounded-lg`
- Brand gradient: primary CTAs only — do not overuse

## Theme

- Dark mode default; full light mode parity required
- Test every new component in both themes
- Glass effect (`backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5`) — navigation and overlays only

## Components

- Use specs from `docs/11_COMPONENT_LIBRARY.md` for domain components
- States required: loading, empty, error for all data views
- Toast feedback for all Server Action success/failure
- ConfirmationDialog for destructive actions (leave, remove, cancel)

## Motion

- Framer Motion in Client Components only
- Durations: 150–350ms; stagger lists 50ms
- Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Accessibility

- WCAG 2.1 AA target
- Focus rings on all interactive elements
- `aria-label` on icon-only buttons
- Form labels with `htmlFor`
- Live region for join status changes

## Icons

- Lucide React only
- Sizes per UI System (16px inline, 20px nav, 48px empty states)

## Mobile-First

- Design for 375px first
- Bottom nav on dashboard mobile; sidebar on desktop
- Sticky join CTA on public event page mobile
